*E_NAME		"Blacksmith Umph"

*E_CHAT		"These are Navisko's specialties.    Only I can produce them. Take a lookat my precious products."
*E_CHAT		"There is no one who manufactures    stronger weapons and armory than me in this continent."  
*E_CHAT		"SOD warriors never show up here.    Does it mean that they don't care   for my weapons? How strong are they?"
*E_CHAT		"If you have something to sell, take them out. If you need something,    this is the place for the strongest equipments in the continent."  